# What `gcloud run deploy --source` uploads to Cloud Build. Only the server
# image's inputs (see Dockerfile) - never the phone apps, whose folders hold
# signing and API secrets (ios/Config/Secrets.xcconfig, android/local.properties).
.gcloudignore
.git
.gitignore
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
android/
ios/
tests/
docs/
branding/
state*.json
*.tmp
deploy/
